m=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3bb5157ebf9b6e8c017de252d4d26e0d, https://si.imgix.net/92e4469a/uploads/origins/25edabd7-6848-46e9-aa1c-72618e30133b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=538ddea7ff44f23317c8dd20f3fae2bc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/92e4469a/uploads/origins/25edabd7-6848-46e9-aa1c-72618e30133b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ed05661adc660fe21f563298a9922a6e 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you!\nI’m someone who thoroughly enjoyed playing through the scenarios “LoveLabyrinth” and its sequel “EurekaElegy,” both created by Serizon.\n\nI’m reaching out to request illustrations of the explorers who completed those scenarios.\n\nBelow are the character details.\n-----------------\nCharacter 1\nHO1: Scum (Attacker)\nA playboy who speaks in a Kansai dialect.\nHe used to be the kind of scumbag who would indiscriminately hit on anyone, but now that he has an older boyfriend, he can’t act the way he used to and tends to get played like a puppet.\nHe hasn’t shaken off his playboy habits and still wavers when girls try to seduce him. (Every time this happens, HO2 gives him a hard time.)\nHe has beige-tinged brown hair and narrow, almond-shaped eyes with a white ring around the iris. He has fox-like features.\n\nCharacter ②\nHO2: Himo (Uke)\nHe has a carefree and elusive personality.\nHe’s fairly experienced. He finds it cute when his younger boyfriend gets swept up in his whirlwind.\nFlashy patterned shirts + round glasses (see image).\nHe used to be the type who didn’t care much about clothes and changed his style constantly, but now he dresses like this to match his lover’s tastes.\nHe generally likes to be in control, but sometimes he gets caught off guard and loses his rhythm.\nBlonde hair with a strong yellow tint, pink eyes. Due to his outfit, he looks like a shady older guy with a rough appearance at first glance.\n-----------------\nA 25-year-old × 29-year-old younger × older couple.\nThey started as a physical relationship, but are now mutually in love.\n\nThere are no specific requests regarding clothing or composition, so I would appreciate it if you could draw it in a way that is easiest for you, Serizon-san.\n\n◼︎Intended Use\n・For personal viewing\n・For use as an icon or header\n・To share with my partner\n\nIf there are any issues with the content or payment, please don’t hesitate to ask me to resend it…!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1VtQoEDNgpmEEQWP0LC8FtzDRY2pJhA6I", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@CeRizaya/works/13", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f3da94dc/uploads/origins/c3b10edd-cf5f-4c6d-8f26-7b8837c37c13?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=bd6bb00cb2a070862d516c5422223fb9", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f3da94dc/uploads/origins/c3b10edd-cf5f-4c6d-8f26-7b8837c37c13?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=bd6bb00cb2a070862d516c5422223fb9, https://si.imgix.net/f3da94dc/uploads/origins/c3b10edd-cf5f-4c6d-8f26-7b8837c37c13?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=f410acbabc926f58511fec4813f3f5ad 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f3da94dc/uploads/origins/c3b10edd-cf5f-4c6d-8f26-7b8837c37c13?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=9683f1ce8e47f10df85ba3e3dd7d69ab 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1154207, "client_id": 3304789, "nc": 144}, {"path": "/