ooking at your wonderful illustrations...!\nI also enjoyed your TRPG scenario!\n\nIf you don't mind, I would like to ask you to draw a self-seeker and his partner who passed \"LoveLabyrinth\" and \"EurekaElegy\"...!\nI would appreciate it if you would consider the request as described in the \"Request.txt\" in the document URL, if you would be willing to do so.\n\nWe have also saved a standing picture of the character as a sample, which we will share with you.\nWe will leave the composition and facial expressions to you as you see fit.\n\nIf the amount is not sufficient, please send it back to us...!\nWe would appreciate it if you would consider our proposal as long as it is reasonable.\n\nIf we have the opportunity to work together, we would appreciate it very much.\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/scl/fo/vqzg8jasfv7cuxz9attic/AN-a0ww9dazLk77J3zZU_SU?rlkey=ewxqyswwe995bnpyxs3ops0qh&st=9y11k274&dl=0", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@CeRizaya/works/11", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c04f240b/uploads/origins/0dc00492-a117-4ed0-a4dd-0d3d320e97c4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=66134b4dba9422735f188a1060a33ab3", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c04f240b/uploads/origins/0dc00492-a117-4ed0-a4dd-0d3d320e97c4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=66134b4dba9422735f188a1060a33ab3, https://si.imgix.net/c04f240b/uploads/origins/0dc00492-a117-4ed0-a4dd-0d3d320e97c4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=6549a1034cfadd948048f33584d8ae28 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c04f240b/uploads/origins/0dc00492-a1